[0.000, "o", "      gap: Human attestation is required: documented evidence of a named reviewer's sign-off on model changes to 'fraud-detection-v2' (endpoint: 'fraud-detection-endpoint') before deployment must be provided. This could include: (1) a change management ticket or pull request with named approver, (2) a model review board sign-off document, (3) a deployment approval record referencing the specific model version, or (4) any linked artifact demonstrating that a human reviewer reviewed and approved the model changes prior to deployment. This evidence cannot be retrieved from AWS infrastructure and must be supplied by the responsible team.\r\n\r\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\r\n"]
